        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/uvekhen_tzaddiqim/text"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/uvekhen_tzaddiqim">And thus may the righteous see and rejoice and the upright exult and the pious revel with joy. Vice shall close its mouth and all evil entirely disappear like smoke when Thou removest the dominion of arrogance from the earth.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
